<title>USA: Jacor to buy Portland radio station.</title>
<headline>Jacor to buy Portland radio station.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, Ky. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacor Communications Inc said on Tuesday that it has agreed to buy KOTK-AM of Portland, Oregon, for $8.3 million from  EXCL Communications Inc.</p>
<p>Jacor owns, operates, represents or provides programming for 126 radio statins in 28 U.S. broadcast areas, it said.</p>
